  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6302.27 “Recertifying supervisor” means a breath test operator, authorized by the commissioner, who has met the eligibility requirements in Saf-C 6303.02.\n\nSource. #8064, INTERIM, eff 4-1-04, EXPIRES: 9-28-04 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6300); ss by #8114, eff 7-14-04; ss by #9683, eff 3-23-10 (from Saf-C 6301.33); renumbered by #12064 (formerly Saf-C 6301.27)",
